[{"answer":"My grandfather is getting old.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/1.mp3"},{"answer":"When I was younger, my grandfather would carry me on his shoulders,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/2.mp3"},{"answer":"and we would go for a walk.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, my grandfather cannot put me on his shoulders.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/4.mp3"},{"answer":"He has a hard time walking, and he uses a cane.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/5.mp3"},{"answer":"My grandfather used to have lots of hair.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Now he is bald.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/7.mp3"},{"answer":"His skin doesn't look like it used to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/8.mp3"},{"answer":"It is more wrinkled.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/9.mp3"},{"answer":"My grandfather takes more naps than he used to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/10.mp3"},{"answer":"He goes to the doctor's, and takes pills for his heart.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I love my grandfather very much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/12.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't like the fact that he is getting older,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/13.mp3"},{"answer":"but my mother says that growing older is just a fact of life.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/14.mp3"},{"answer":"She says that we will all get older.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes my grandfather forgets things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/16.mp3"},{"answer":"My mother says to be patient.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/17.mp3"},{"answer":"I am patient.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/18.mp3"},{"answer":"I try to help my grandfather as much as I can.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/19.mp3"},{"answer":"I sometimes go for walks with him.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/20.mp3"},{"answer":"I help him to walk when he has trouble.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/21.mp3"},{"answer":"I cheer him up if I think he might be sad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I get things for him, and I even read to him at night.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/23.mp3"},{"answer":"He used to read to me when I was little.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Now his eyesight is bad,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/25.mp3"},{"answer":"and he can't see very well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/26.mp3"},{"answer":"My grandfather tells me stories about when he was a boy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/27.mp3"},{"answer":"The world was a very different place then he tells me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/28.mp3"},{"answer":"His stories are interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes I wish we could trade places for a day","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/30.mp3"},{"answer":"so that I would know what it felt like to be old.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/31.mp3"},{"answer":"My grandfather doesn't complain.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/32.mp3"},{"answer":"He jokes about his old bones.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/33.mp3"},{"answer":"I spend a lot of time with my grandfather.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/34.mp3"},{"answer":"I hope that he is around for a long time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/96-getting-old-2019-04-07-03-51-54/35.mp3"}]
